OL,3,AZelensky backs Trump's 'energy
OL,4,Aceasefire' but says Russia continues to
OL,5,Ahit power plants
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump has claimed that Russia
OL,8,Fand Ukraine have agreed to an "energy
OL,9,Fceasefire", with Kyiv saying it would
OL,10,Fsupport such a move but Moscow yet to
OL,11,Fcomment.
OL,13,FThe US president insisted that it was
OL,14,F"effective immediately" but provided no
OL,15,Fdetails.
OL,17,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,18,Finitially expressed surprise at the
OL,19,Fannouncement, before saying Kyiv would
OL,20,Fsupport it if Moscow did. He also
OL,21,Faccused Russia of striking Ukrainian
OL,22,Fenergy facilities after Trump's post.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
