OL,3,AZelensky backs Trump's 'energy
OL,4,Aceasefire' but says Russia continues to
OL,5,Ahit power plants
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump has been urging Ukraine to stop
OL,8,Fstrikes on Russian oil infrastructure -
OL,9,Fwhich Kyiv says are vital to curtailing
OL,10,Frevenue for Moscow's war machine - so
OL,11,FRussia can fulfil a recently-struck
OL,12,Fdeal to release diesel to the US and
OL,13,Fthe global market.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
